  (text "RF can power U7 while main3.3V is absent. VOUT isolation alone does not bound signal backfeed.\nFive TMUX1511 channels interrupt CS/SCK/MOSI/MISO/IRQ on reset and main-power loss.\nHost pullups remain main-side; RF-side CS high and SCK/MOSI low have local passive defaults.\nThe3.6V off-terminal rating is a LIMIT; excessive RF, faults, negative transients and ramps need tests.\nR69 uses a20uA aggregate off-feed allocation, not an assumed guarantee from the FM11 brief.\nNo security service is enabled by RF field, IRQ or reset release. Production Root still required."
    (at 205 275 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.05 1.05)
      )
    )
    (uuid "28815904-cb97-592b-b552-31fc45a2e89f")
  )
)
